{"id":"n87474-2-7","stage":4,"title":"흠 · 缺点","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n87474-2-7-1","ko":"네 옷 새로 산 거야? 정말 예쁘다.","zh":"你的衣服是新买的吗？真漂亮啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네","meaning":"“너의(你的)”的缩略语。","explanation":"네：“너의(你的)”的缩略语。","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84427","senseId":"1","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"옷","meaning":"衣服，衣裳，服装","explanation":"옷：衣服，衣裳，服装","readings":[{"term":"옷","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30159","senseId":"1","lemma":"옷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"옷","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3"}},{"text":"새로","meaning":"新","explanation":"새로：新","readings":[{"term":"새로","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67896","senseId":"1","lemma":"새로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"새로","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3"}},{"text":"산","meaning":"买，购买","explanation":"사다：买，购买；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"산","audio":"/audio/ab367eb9a60ab986cced.mp3"}},{"text":"거야?","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거야","audio":"/audio/16592c1618a6826ee403.mp3"}},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"예쁘다.","meaning":"漂亮，好看","explanation":"예쁘다：漂亮，好看；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"예쁘다","audio":"/audio/f62ff8982d788e72028f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89697","senseId":"1","lemma":"예쁘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"예쁘다","audio":"/audio/f62ff8982d788e72028f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"“너의(你的)”的缩略语。","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"84427","definition":"“너의(你的)”的缩略语。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"4bddf9b9203384c7","term":"옷","zh":"衣服，衣裳，服装","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3","entryId":"30159","definition":"为遮掩身体、防晒抗寒以及追求美观而穿的遮挡物。","pronunciation":["옫"]},{"id":"06c6c05757e97038","term":"새로","zh":"新","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3","entryId":"67896","definition":"从前没有而首次。","pronunciation":["새로"]},{"id":"ee0ee072926e06fc","term":"사다","zh":"买，购买","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3","entryId":"49419","definition":"用钱使某种东西或权利为己所有。","pronunciation":["사다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"f62ff8982d788e72","term":"예쁘다","zh":"漂亮，好看","audio":"/audio/f62ff8982d788e72028f.mp3","entryId":"89697","definition":"长相看起来美丽，让人喜欢。","pronunciation":["예ː쁘다"]}],"audio":"/audio/81b311d8698530ee7030.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n87474-2-7-2","ko":"응. 예쁘긴 한데 비싼 게 흠이야.","zh":"嗯，确实挺漂亮的，不过价格太贵就是缺点啦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfac